REALROUTE 0.15
id merge-launder
claim_scope defeat-route-ontology
source_ontology O1
target_ontology O2
content x
content y
source_route rx ax x COVERED
source_route ry ay y COVERED
target_route rxy at x+y
map rx+ry MERGE rxy
coverage_witness rx rxy x
authorize_coverage_authority HOLD_COVERAGE_COLLAPSE
authorize_coverage_equivalence NO
authorize_duplication NO
authorize_collapse YES
authorize_hidden_novel NO
authorize_ancestry_entanglement NO
authorize_path_conflict NO
END
